# Schema geo

## Class Diagram

This diagram uses Mermaid's labelled class form and needs Mermaid 10.1.0 or later.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class County {
        fips String
    }
    class common_Region["common.Region"] {
        code RegionCode
        name String
    }
    class Basin__base_["Basin (base)"] {
        id String
    }
    County --> common_Region : IN_REGION (one)
    common_Region --> Basin__base_ : IN_BASIN (_)
```

